Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.56,0:15:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ini justru penurunan yang bagus!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.11,0:15:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini pasti seperti ancang-ancang\Nsebelum melompat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menunduk dulu\Nuntuk mengumpulkan tenaga!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.49,0:15:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Agar bisa melompat lebih tinggi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Demi bisa melampaui 96 yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.83,0:15:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Artinya, tindakan yang harus\Nkuambil adalah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}biarkan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.68,0:16:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menahan posisi ini dan bertaruh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Parah, nih.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.19,0:16:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kelewat momen untuk jual.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.25,0:16:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya melambat sebelum\Nmencapai 96 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.77,0:16:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau turun perlahan begini,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.79,0:16:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}susah mengambil posisi jual baru.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, mendingan dibanding Kurumi\Nyang memegang posisi beli.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Mochiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biasanya, sebelum melonjak tinggi\Npasti turun dulu, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, pergerakan begitu sering terjadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.83,0:16:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang dinamakan jebakan penurunan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}S-Sekarang AUD/JPY juga sedang\Ndi fase jebakan penurunan
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.75,0:16:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan ini masa persiapan untuk\Nmenembus 96 yen, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.17,0:16:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, semoga saja begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masa bodoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.50,0:16:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat! Turun lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.78,0:17:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harusnya cut loss saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Payah banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat, gawat, gawat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.60,0:17:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana ini, kalau begini terus...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.76,0:17:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, jangan-jangan...
