Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.18,0:17:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}D-Dari harga beli...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sudah turun sekitar 1 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.59,0:17:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}T-Tapi...
