Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}di kisaran 94 yen\Nada tekanan beli yang kuat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dinding pertahanan...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}terlihat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.33,0:17:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang waktunya bersabar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Walau rugi sementara parah,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}asal tidak melakukan cut loss...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:17:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:17:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}94 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.65,0:18:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Batas cut loss otomatisku!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.49,0:18:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begini aku tidak akan tahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.56,0:18:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cut loss otomatis adalah
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.02,0:18:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}salah satu sistem penutupan\Nposisi secara otomatis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.41,0:18:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi ujian jadi enggak bisa\Nmelihat pasar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan pantau secara otomatis!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pengawasan AI!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.78,0:18:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Walau dalam kondisi tidak bisa\Nmemutuskan sendiri,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.81,0:18:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}berdasarkan standar yang ditetapkan\Nperusahaan Forex,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}transaksi cut loss\Nakan dieksekusi secara paksa...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lebih dari ini berbahaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kulakukan cut loss!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.70,0:18:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}demi melindungi investor\Ndari potensi kerugian tak terduga.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan bercanda!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cut loss otomatis...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.97,0:18:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}begitu menyentuh batas sebentar\Nlangsung dieksekusi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.82,0:19:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka akan mengeksekusi tanpa ampun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.53,0:19:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dalam kasusku,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.71,0:19:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kalau terkena cut loss otomatis,\Nseluruh saldo akan habis
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan sebagai investor... aku mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.18,0:19:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}E-Enggak...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak mau...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.70,0:19:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak mau.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak mau!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.43,0:19:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak mau, enggak mau!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak mau, enggak mau, enggak mau!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.15,0:19:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku... enggak mau mati!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.41,0:19:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.20,0:19:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak mau kalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pokoknya ibu dan anak\Nenggak boleh sama-sama kalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Uang...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.19,0:19:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asalkan ada... uang...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:20:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pinjam 3 juta yen dariku,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.54,0:20:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}lalu beli menggunakan uang itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, Ayah pergi dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.11,0:20:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hati-hati di jalan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus melakukannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak perlu\Nmeminjam uang dari Mochiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.98,0:20:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena aku tahu...
