Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.65,0:20:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menambah deposit ke akun Forex
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.98,0:20:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk menurunkan\Nbatas cut loss otomatis!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.54,0:20:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tahu ini tindakan berbahaya,
