Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.78,0:23:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suka ikut campur itu menyebalkan, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.18,0:23:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kan bukan anak-anak lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.34,0:23:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Urusanku sendiri, aku yang tentukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.64,0:23:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Paham, Mas Loss Cut?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan sembarangan cut loss!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.58,0:23:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan putuskan ikatan keluarga kami!
